@HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5096
@apiKey = devkey
@userId = 00000000000000000000000000000000

### Performance against MSCI World and the S&P 500 (range: Week, Month, Quarter, YearToDate, Year, All)
GET {{HostAddress}}/insights/performance?userId={{userId}}&range=Year
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Currencies, sectors, countries, concentration
GET {{HostAddress}}/insights/exposure?userId={{userId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Realized gains of a year
GET {{HostAddress}}/insights/realized?userId={{userId}}&year=2026
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### The goals' starting point
GET {{HostAddress}}/insights/goals?userId={{userId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### The AI coach
GET {{HostAddress}}/insights/coach?userId={{userId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Start a review (poll the GET above)
POST {{HostAddress}}/insights/coach?userId={{userId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
